“Listen FM” is an application for listening to online radio stations via the internet. The application includes more than 1000 stations in 7 languages: Russian, English, German, French, Chinese, Spanish and Japanese. For ease of selection, all the stations are divided into 16 musical directions. The number of stations is constantly updated.

— A wide range of radio stations. More than 1000 radio stations. From the most popular to the “exotic”;

— The different types of music genres. Pop, rock, punk and ska, dance, electronic music, relaxation, rap and R'n'B, dancehall and reggae, jazz and blues, instrumental music, retro, talk radio, humor, children's radio;

— Favorites. You can save favorite stations, and they are always at hand;

— Sync your favorites. Instantly sync favorites across the cloud with all your devices (for this mode, you need to connect to the cloud through the program menu);

— The listening history. You can always find the recently played station;

— Pause when calling. During an incoming call, the app stops playing the radio and continues to play after the call end;

— Music in your car. Connecting to the vehicle's audio system using a Bluetooth;

— 5 skins. Purple, blue, green, white and black. You can change the color design of application.

— Owners of radio stations.  If you want to add your station to our application, write to us at mail — info@pawga.ru
